Raw string equality misses real cases on macOS and Linux:
- macOS APFS case-insensitive default: `/Users/Foo` vs `/Users/foo` pass `!==` but resolve to the same dir.
- Symlinked home or project: user `cd`s through a symlinked path, cwd string differs from `homedir()` even though they are the same inode.
